  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Core.GamePlay.StoryOne
  CurrentCurtainController: {fileID: 524046097}
  MsgObj: {fileID: 1294476774}
  MsgBubble: {fileID: 1869091476}
  MsgTxt: {fileID: 543073970}
  NameTxt: {fileID: 1927081778}
  Messages:
  - I want to tell you something. Our relationship comes to its end.
  - "I promise. Next month I will buy you that expensive watch you wanted. please
    don\u2019t leave me."
  - 'I want a luxury life, the kind of life you could never give me, and I have already
    made my decision. '
  - "After four years, you are saying this? I even sold my ancestral home for you.
    Wasn\u2019t that proof of my love?"
  - Stop hiding and tell me who he is.
  - "There\u2019s no need to hide anything anymore. Meet him this is Rohan Singhania,
    the CEO of FreshNova Drinks. Only a rich and successful man like him is worthy
    of me."
  - 'So you were playing with me all this time? How could you do this to me? '
  - How could you even think someone could fall in love with a loser like you?
  - "Let\u2019s go, baby. We can\u2019t waste our precious time on this trash. "
  - 'I will make you regret. From now on, I have only one goal: to become rich and
    famous.'
  MessengerName:
  - Sara
  - Kabir
  - Sara
  - Kabir
  - Kabir
  - Sara
  - Kabir
  - Sara
  - Rohan
  - Kabir
  BubbleRotation:
